# Documentation

Documentation is part of the implementation.

Update the relevant doc in the same change when you alter architecture, folder
structure, business rules, public Convex contracts, design tokens, or engineering
standards.

Authority: Constitution → Context → domain docs.

`.cursor/rules/` should reference documentation rather than duplicating long docs.
